WEBVTT

00:23.690 --> 00:24.760
Nao-chan.

00:25.770 --> 00:28.420
Oh, leaving already?

00:28.850 --> 00:30.080
Yeah, I'm off.

00:30.640 --> 00:32.650
Did you pack all the gifts?

00:32.650 --> 00:33.490
Yeah.

00:33.490 --> 00:35.270
Say hi to everyone for me.

00:35.270 --> 00:36.220
Will do.

00:36.220 --> 00:38.720
<i>The train will arrive shortly.</i>

01:16.090 --> 01:18.230
<i>Thank you for flying with us today.</i>

01:18.230 --> 01:23.100
<i>Please remain seated with your seatbelt 
fastened while the seatbelt sign is on.</i>

02:11.300 --> 02:14.680
<i>So dazzling</i>

02:14.680 --> 02:18.120
<i>I find myself looking away</i>

02:18.840 --> 02:21.740
<i>Unable to find the right words</i>

02:21.740 --> 02:24.530
<i>Even a single word to say</i>

02:38.880 --> 02:41.600
<i>In such a narrow world</i>

02:41.600 --> 02:45.390
<i>Your vibrant laughter</i>

02:45.390 --> 02:48.350
<i>Resonates so beautifully</i>

02:48.350 --> 02:51.160
<i>And that's what saved me</i>

02:51.600 --> 02:55.260
<i>If we relive this moment</i>

02:55.260 --> 02:58.480
<i>In an unimaginable future</i>

02:58.480 --> 03:01.450
<i>Even if we're lost, it's okay</i>

03:01.450 --> 03:05.290
<i>We will be in it together</i>

03:05.980 --> 03:09.280
<i>So dazzling</i>

03:09.280 --> 03:13.080
<i>I find myself looking away</i>

03:13.450 --> 03:16.370
<i>Unable to find the right words</i>

03:16.370 --> 03:19.200
<i>Even a single word to say</i>

03:19.200 --> 03:22.530
<i>I was entranced</i>

03:22.530 --> 03:26.640
<i>By your lively figure</i>

03:26.640 --> 03:29.790
<i>If the true nature of this blue warmth</i>

03:29.790 --> 03:32.570
<i>Is love, then…</i>

03:33.300 --> 03:36.430
<i>If the true nature of this blue warmth</i>

03:36.430 --> 03:39.210
<i>Is love, then...</i>

03:44.050 --> 03:47.210
So many people... Think we'll find her?

03:47.680 --> 03:49.950
Oh, is that her? Hey!

03:49.950 --> 03:51.850
Sis!

03:53.790 --> 03:55.670
What's up with her?

03:55.670 --> 03:57.390
She's puttin' on big-city airs.

03:58.150 --> 04:01.550
Nobody changes that much in four months.

04:02.380 --> 04:04.350
I'll carry your suitcase.

04:04.350 --> 04:05.500
Thanks.

04:05.890 --> 04:06.950
Sis!

04:06.950 --> 04:08.060
What is it?

04:08.060 --> 04:12.220
Notice how there wasn't any corn 
in the last care package?

04:12.220 --> 04:13.460
Oh, yeah.

04:13.460 --> 04:17.560
There was so much rain this year, 
we couldn't grow anything decent.

04:17.560 --> 04:21.440
There were so many civets, too. 
We might just skip it next year.

04:22.400 --> 04:24.050
I'm home!

04:25.550 --> 04:29.120
Grandma! Sis is home!

04:29.140 --> 04:31.120
Wow, candies! So cute!

04:31.120 --> 04:33.090
Thanks, Sis!

04:33.090 --> 04:36.780
For Mom and Dad, keychains and...

04:37.220 --> 04:39.270
Apparently, this yokan's really good.

04:39.270 --> 04:42.340
My, you didn't have to get us all this!

04:42.750 --> 04:44.540
Is Nao-chan working today?

04:44.540 --> 04:45.700
Yeah.

04:45.700 --> 04:48.620
Then I'll call to thank her later tonight.

04:48.620 --> 04:50.410
Dad, where's Grandma?

04:50.410 --> 04:52.080
Cooking red rice in the yard.

04:55.990 --> 04:58.160
Grandma, I'm home.

04:58.160 --> 05:00.990
Welcome home, Mitsumi-chan.

05:00.990 --> 05:05.220
I heard you'd be back, so I figured 
I'd make us somethin' special.

05:05.220 --> 05:08.190
What? You didn't need to go to the trouble!

05:08.190 --> 05:12.710
Well, truth told, it's just 
an excuse so I can eat it.

05:16.010 --> 05:21.710
You splash on a lot of water and 
steam it for ten more minutes.

05:22.090 --> 05:24.210
I'll set a timer and keep an eye on it.

05:24.690 --> 05:28.340
Oh? Didn't know it could do that, too.

05:28.340 --> 05:29.910
It's real handy.

05:30.950 --> 05:32.770
I'll check on my tomatoes.

05:33.220 --> 05:34.620
'Kay.

05:34.620 --> 05:38.010
Cover up yer legs or them 
skeeters'll suck them dry.

05:43.170 --> 05:47.150
The first scoop is for 
the gods and the spirits.

05:53.870 --> 05:55.540
Take the rest to the dinin' room.

05:55.540 --> 05:56.620
Okay.

06:09.990 --> 06:12.310
Hey! That's bad manners, Sis!

06:12.310 --> 06:15.770
A little bit of bad manners adds flavor.

06:16.220 --> 06:17.020
Oh?

06:18.170 --> 06:20.360
Sea bream sashimi!

06:21.020 --> 06:24.480
What, we already having a feast for lunch?

06:24.820 --> 06:26.650
Well, yeah.

06:26.650 --> 06:31.280
Mom and Dad kept talking 
about what to feed you.

07:12.580 --> 07:15.050
Sis. Your phone's ringing.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.230
Hello?

07:19.710 --> 07:21.250
Mitsumi-chan!

07:22.370 --> 07:23.540
Fumi!

07:24.800 --> 07:26.700
It's Fumi!

07:26.700 --> 07:29.050
It's Mitsumi-chan!

07:29.540 --> 07:33.550
The gang wanted to get together 
since you were coming home.

07:34.840 --> 07:37.810
They're all in front of the shrine already.

07:37.810 --> 07:41.690
I didn't think I'd see all our 
middle school mates right away!

07:41.690 --> 07:45.570
Yukko's dad says he'll drive everyone 
who came far back home.

07:45.570 --> 07:46.680
Really?!

07:46.680 --> 07:49.570
He's chatting with my pa now.

07:49.570 --> 07:55.360
I was gonna ask if I could have 
some big ol' fireworks tomorrow!

07:56.410 --> 07:58.660
Hey, uh, Mitsumi-chan...

08:00.350 --> 08:05.880
I'm going out with that boy 
I told you about before.

08:06.130 --> 08:06.970
<i>Huh?</i>

08:07.880 --> 08:11.420
Wait, for real?! Congrats!

08:09.890 --> 08:12.630
Thanks... but keep it down!

08:12.630 --> 08:14.230
Since when? When?!

08:14.230 --> 08:17.200
S-Start of summer break.

08:17.200 --> 08:23.240
I knew I wouldn't see him for a bit, 
so I asked for his contact deets.

08:23.060 --> 08:25.150
<b></b>Yamada-sensei
was right

08:23.240 --> 08:25.150
We texted for a while, and then...

08:38.660 --> 08:40.410
Do the others know?

08:40.920 --> 08:42.810
Naw. Not yet.

08:42.810 --> 08:45.920
I wanted you to be the first to know.

08:49.470 --> 08:52.700
Fumi-san, have you gotten 
prettier, perchance?

08:52.700 --> 08:55.470
Oh, you! What about yourself, Mitsumi-san?

08:55.470 --> 08:56.550
Huh?!

08:57.260 --> 08:58.770
Ooh, they're here!

08:58.770 --> 08:59.720
Mitsumi!

08:59.720 --> 09:01.200
You doin' all right?

09:01.200 --> 09:01.870
Yep.

09:01.870 --> 09:03.480
You ain't changed a bit.

09:03.480 --> 09:07.790
Nah, I'm classier now. Though 
I guess you wouldn't get it, Tacchan.

09:07.790 --> 09:10.680
I see yer wearing the same shirt 
from middle school, at least.

09:30.650 --> 09:32.180
Oh, it's lit!

09:40.260 --> 09:46.240
Come to think of it, did ya quit 
practicin' your Standard Japanese?

09:48.820 --> 09:49.690
Yeah.

09:57.210 --> 10:01.990
I found friends that won't 
make fun of me over my dialect.

10:01.990 --> 10:02.930
So it's whatever.

10:04.230 --> 10:05.730
There's a whole rocket in here!

10:05.730 --> 10:06.790
Seriously?

10:06.790 --> 10:08.530
Heck yeah! Light her up!

10:08.530 --> 10:09.680
Let's go!

10:25.930 --> 10:28.100
Sis still ain't up.

10:28.100 --> 10:30.440
She used to wake up second after Grandma.

10:30.440 --> 10:32.460
Should I wake her up? 
Fumi-chan will be here soon.

10:32.460 --> 10:34.940
Let her sleep while she can.

10:34.940 --> 10:39.120
She probably just feels free now she's home.

10:42.920 --> 10:46.870
Goo mong...

10:46.870 --> 10:50.400
'Bout time! Want some toast?

10:50.400 --> 10:51.470
I'm good.

10:52.380 --> 10:55.110
Ate too much yesterday.

10:55.110 --> 10:56.270
Watermelon?

10:56.860 --> 10:58.540
Please.

10:58.540 --> 10:59.350
On it.

10:59.900 --> 11:03.250
Mom, what 'bout work?

11:03.250 --> 11:05.580
I took a day off.

11:05.580 --> 11:08.100
Thanks, but you didn't hafta.

11:08.100 --> 11:09.630
I wanted to.

11:58.470 --> 12:00.280
Mornin'!

12:01.310 --> 12:03.140
Sis, Fumi-chan's here!

12:03.140 --> 12:04.850
Huh? What?!

12:04.850 --> 12:06.490
Oh, it's that time already?!

12:06.870 --> 12:10.520
Sorry, Fumi! I'll be right out!

12:10.520 --> 12:13.490
What's this? You never 
oversleep, Mitsumi-chan!

12:13.490 --> 12:15.880
Hurry up, Sis!

12:23.970 --> 12:27.970
<u>Scene 09: Drowsy and Peppy</u>

12:47.490 --> 12:48.990
<b>Squirm</b>

12:47.660 --> 12:48.990
<b>Huge Sea Hare</b>

12:48.990 --> 12:50.800
Stay away from me!

12:50.800 --> 12:53.620
But it's so cute! Look!

12:57.980 --> 12:59.060
Yeah!

13:08.250 --> 13:09.600
<i>Summer break is over,</i>

13:09.600 --> 13:11.430
<i>and we're back to school today!</i>

13:12.180 --> 13:13.870
Good morning!

13:13.870 --> 13:15.270
Hello.

13:15.780 --> 13:16.770
<i>Long time no see.</i>

13:20.030 --> 13:21.940
You'll miss your plane.

13:21.940 --> 13:24.610
I don't wanna go!

13:25.100 --> 13:27.970
<i>I cried a little, but that's all in the past.</i>

13:27.970 --> 13:29.080
<i>Let's do this!</i>

13:29.080 --> 13:30.740
<i>Yeah!</i>

13:30.740 --> 13:33.030
<i>I'm Iwakura Mitsumi, fifteen years old.</i>

13:33.030 --> 13:35.250
<i>And I'm back to being a city girl!</i>

13:41.900 --> 13:43.300
Shima-kun, good morning.

13:43.980 --> 13:46.180
Hey, Mitsumi-chan. Long time no see.

13:47.220 --> 13:48.180
<b>Beam!</b>

13:49.020 --> 13:49.940
What's up?

13:49.940 --> 13:55.630
Oh, just thinking how it's a good omen 
that you're the first classmate I saw today.

13:57.220 --> 13:58.600
What's with that?

14:00.160 --> 14:01.610
You've really tanned.

14:01.610 --> 14:04.500
Right? I went to the beach 
every day back home.

14:04.500 --> 14:05.780
A little to the right.

14:05.780 --> 14:07.350
It's Kanechika-senpai.

14:07.350 --> 14:09.030
Okay, that will do.

14:09.030 --> 14:11.700
Senpai! Good morning!

14:11.700 --> 14:14.160
Mitsumi-kun, Shima-kun! Morning!

14:14.160 --> 14:16.300
Preparing for the school festival?

14:16.300 --> 14:17.000
Yeah.

14:17.000 --> 14:21.630
We're making all the big props first 
to get people motivated.

14:22.710 --> 14:27.700
And it can only be a good sign 
that I saw Shima-kun so soon, too.

14:27.700 --> 14:30.210
<i>What am I, some kind of good luck charm?</i>

14:30.210 --> 14:32.340
Oh, right. Hang on a sec.

14:34.640 --> 14:36.390
<b>K's Sunday</b>

14:34.640 --> 14:37.120
Here's the script 
for our school festival play.

14:37.120 --> 14:40.170
It's one of my best works to date!

14:40.170 --> 14:44.980
Don't worry, I'm not recruiting you. 
It's already been cast.

14:44.980 --> 14:47.360
But could you give it a read?

14:47.360 --> 14:50.030
I just want to hear your thoughts on it.

14:53.330 --> 14:58.120
If I take this, you'll think I'm interested 
and start bugging me again, right, Senpai?

14:58.710 --> 15:00.000
You got me.

15:09.780 --> 15:13.670
Do come see the play, though!

15:15.010 --> 15:16.310
Mitsumi!

15:16.310 --> 15:18.560
Yuzu-chan! Makocchan!

15:18.560 --> 15:21.210
You're back! And look at that tan!

15:21.210 --> 15:23.920
Makocchan, did you get paler instead?

15:23.920 --> 15:24.810
Did I?

15:25.180 --> 15:27.030
Mika-chan! Good mor...

15:28.410 --> 15:29.410
What's this?

15:29.410 --> 15:31.240
Cookies from a famous place in Kyoto.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.990
Give one to Nao-san, too.

15:35.110 --> 15:35.860
Yum.

15:35.860 --> 15:37.970
Wow, thanks! So cute!

15:37.970 --> 15:41.170
When did you and Nao-chan get so friendly?

15:41.170 --> 15:43.750
Urk. L-Long story.

15:44.090 --> 15:44.130
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.090 --> 15:45.500
That reminds me.

15:44.130 --> 15:44.250
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.250 --> 15:44.380
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.380 --> 15:44.500
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.500 --> 15:44.630
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.630 --> 15:44.750
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.750 --> 15:44.880
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:44.880 --> 15:45.500
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:45.500 --> 15:46.890
Ta-dah!

15:45.500 --> 15:49.510
<b>Ta-dah</b>

15:45.500 --> 15:49.510
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

15:46.890 --> 15:49.510
My hometown's famous squid crackers!

15:51.410 --> 15:52.260
Yum.

15:52.260 --> 15:54.410
You eat everything you get right away, huh?

15:54.410 --> 15:56.580
I have some for Shima-kun 
and the others, too.

15:57.220 --> 15:59.450
Hey, any stories of romance 
over summer break?

15:57.550 --> 15:59.850
Oh, just missed them.

15:59.450 --> 16:00.380
Yeah, right.

16:00.380 --> 16:02.540
You'll have plenty of chances.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.620
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

16:20.770 --> 16:22.350
Watanabe.

16:22.350 --> 16:23.580
Thanks for the notes.

16:23.580 --> 16:24.540
Sure.

16:24.940 --> 16:26.550
You got a girlfriend?!

16:26.550 --> 16:27.990
Pics or it didn't happen!

16:27.990 --> 16:29.090
What the heck?!

16:29.090 --> 16:31.270
Gah! She's even cute!

16:31.270 --> 16:33.170
Maybe I should join a band, too.

16:33.170 --> 16:35.380
Hey, music ain't that easy.

16:36.250 --> 16:37.200
How do I look?

16:37.200 --> 16:40.940
<i>Summer break in high school 
seems to pass by so quickly...</i>

16:40.940 --> 16:43.060
Wow, you tanned a lot.

16:43.060 --> 16:45.700
<i>...but it's also a month of transformation.</i>

16:46.920 --> 16:48.690
<i>Some people get a partner,</i>

16:50.240 --> 16:51.550
<i>while others lose them.</i>

16:52.450 --> 16:54.300
<i>Some gain composure,</i>

16:54.300 --> 16:55.960
<i>while others lighten up.</i>

16:56.410 --> 16:58.800
Those cookies were so good!

16:58.800 --> 16:59.740
Right? They're my favorite.

16:59.740 --> 17:00.960
They're crazy good.

17:00.150 --> 17:01.880
<i>Some grow closer...</i>

17:01.880 --> 17:03.470
Mitsumi, did you try it yet?

17:03.470 --> 17:04.370
Yeah.

17:06.250 --> 17:08.250
I'd asked Watanabe beforehand.

17:07.420 --> 17:09.630
<i>...while others drift away.</i>

17:08.250 --> 17:09.630
I was counting on him!

17:12.080 --> 17:14.670
Are you vibing to the max, Mitsumi-san?

17:14.670 --> 17:17.050
"Vibing"? "Max"?

17:17.050 --> 17:20.230
I mean, are you excited and motivated?

17:20.230 --> 17:24.110
The student council will be very 
busy with the school festival.

17:24.110 --> 17:25.790
I see.

17:25.790 --> 17:29.830
Our school festival is open 
to the public. It's a big deal.

17:29.830 --> 17:32.250
You've probably never seen 
anything like it, Iwakura-san.

17:32.250 --> 17:33.580
Wow...

17:33.580 --> 17:35.950
<i>Talk about condescending.</i>

17:36.270 --> 17:42.070
Thank you, class and club representatives, 
for being here today.

17:38.200 --> 17:46.460
<b></b>Tsubame West High School
School Festival Primer

17:42.070 --> 17:46.460
The deadline for festival applications 
is the end of this week.

17:46.960 --> 17:50.410
There are many restrictions 
involved, particularly for F&B.

17:50.410 --> 17:55.470
I'd like to go over the restrictions 
and requirements in detail.

17:55.470 --> 18:01.900
As you are aware, prospective students 
and their parents will attend the event.

18:01.900 --> 18:05.760
We'll go over the placement 
of staff that can act as guides.

18:05.350 --> 18:12.900
<b>Haunted House</b>

18:05.760 --> 18:07.680
Please direct them to those locations.

18:07.680 --> 18:10.130
Gas canisters for balloon art,

18:07.980 --> 18:13.020
<b></b>Cooking Class

18:07.980 --> 18:16.490
<b>Karuta Club</b>

18:10.130 --> 18:12.460
power supplies for lighting and neon signs,

18:12.460 --> 18:16.490
large mascot costumes, and many other 
things will require special permission...

18:17.880 --> 18:20.440
It really is a massive deal!

18:22.820 --> 18:24.690
<i>What do I do with these feelings of joy?</i>

18:24.690 --> 18:27.000
<i>If I tell Fumi, it'll be like showing off!</i>

18:26.750 --> 18:29.750
<b>Wow, sounds like a lotta fun...</b>

18:27.000 --> 18:29.750
<i>Wow, sounds like a lotta fun...</i>

18:29.910 --> 18:30.630
<i>Oh.</i>

18:31.260 --> 18:32.380
<i>It's Shima-kun.</i>

18:32.380 --> 18:34.510
<i>Whoa, great timing!</i>

18:34.510 --> 18:36.970
<i>Is he going home now? I want to talk to him!</i>

18:36.970 --> 18:39.720
<i>Is he busy? Would I be a bother?</i>

18:42.660 --> 18:45.100
I'm sorry, Senpai! 
I'll be back in ten minutes!

18:45.100 --> 18:47.350
I'll get the materials ready after I'm back!

18:47.740 --> 18:48.980
Oh, okay.

19:02.450 --> 19:04.950
<b>Squid Crackers</b>

19:02.860 --> 19:04.950
<i>Just because you haven't talked for a while,</i>

19:04.950 --> 19:08.090
<i>you get afraid that they 
might not like you anymore.</i>

19:08.090 --> 19:11.960
<i>But when you're really happy, 
you want to share it.</i>

19:12.970 --> 19:14.530
<i>It's so strange.</i>

19:14.530 --> 19:16.460
Shima-kun!

19:17.170 --> 19:18.860
I caught you!

19:18.860 --> 19:19.720
Right...

19:19.720 --> 19:23.220
This... squid crackers... hometown...

19:24.180 --> 19:25.640
Thanks.

19:26.390 --> 19:27.850
<b>Wheeze</b>

19:27.910 --> 19:29.770
H-Hey...

19:29.770 --> 19:33.960
Did you know that our school festival 
gets nearly 7,000 attendees every year?

19:33.960 --> 19:35.400
It's practically a concert!

19:35.400 --> 19:36.960
Really? Wow...

19:36.960 --> 19:38.350
Isn't it amazing?

19:38.350 --> 19:40.180
We had a meeting about it today.

19:40.180 --> 19:44.590
It's all so crazy! Like, the strategy 
for staff placement and handling guests!

19:44.590 --> 19:46.260
It's the spirit of hospitality, 
through and through!

19:46.260 --> 19:47.230
Wow...

19:47.230 --> 19:49.010
And the courtyard?

19:49.010 --> 19:52.290
It'll be covered in ads and balloons!

19:52.290 --> 19:54.500
There's even a decoration contest!

19:54.500 --> 19:55.400
Mhm...

19:55.400 --> 19:57.540
And then, over there...

20:00.500 --> 20:03.100
Sorry, you probably don't care.

20:03.100 --> 20:05.760
I just wanted to share 
my excitement with you.

20:05.760 --> 20:08.470
You really love these kinds of events.

20:08.470 --> 20:13.510
I mean, I thought you only saw these 
fancy school festivals in TV shows!

20:13.510 --> 20:15.180
It's so exciting!

20:15.930 --> 20:21.190
Oh, but I guess a class rep can't 
be acting like a giddy schoolgirl.

20:21.860 --> 20:23.070
Hey, it's no big deal.

20:23.070 --> 20:25.660
I need to be a cool and 
composed adult like you.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.780
You think too much of me.

20:30.890 --> 20:31.750
See you.

20:32.740 --> 20:33.620
Yeah.

20:35.750 --> 20:37.700
<i>You're wrong, Mitsumi-chan.</i>

20:38.310 --> 20:41.760
So don't think you have any right to have 
a fun little high school life of your own.

20:42.630 --> 20:45.780
<i>I get frozen in place because 
I don't deserve anything.</i>

20:46.390 --> 20:50.840
<i>But you guys keep pushing on, 
full steam ahead.</i>

20:57.210 --> 21:01.050
<i>You're so dazzling... and so far away.</i>

21:08.200 --> 21:10.800
Actually, you seem down, 
so I'll give you three!

21:15.970 --> 21:17.140
See you tomorrow!

21:38.490 --> 21:43.070
<i>With school festival prep, 
September will pass in the blink of an eye.</i>

21:43.070 --> 21:44.750
<i>That'll mean the end of summer,</i>

21:44.750 --> 21:47.070
<i>leaving only two seasons 
before the year's done.</i>

21:50.310 --> 21:53.090
<i>I hope we can cherish 
and enjoy the rest of it.</i>

21:55.330 --> 21:57.330
<b>Class 1-3</b>

21:55.820 --> 21:57.330
With all the votes in, it's decided!

21:57.330 --> 22:00.080
<b>Puzzle Game
Consultation Center
TV Show Screening
Roller Coaster
Maid Cafe</b>

21:57.330 --> 22:00.080
Class 3 will be putting on a play!

22:00.080 --> 22:01.960
It's gonna be tough, but let's do this!

22:01.960 --> 22:03.940
Let's do this, do this, do this, yeah!

22:27.410 --> 22:31.670
<i>A gentle breeze, the setting sun</i>

22:31.670 --> 22:35.990
<i>Today was another good day</i>

22:35.990 --> 22:40.330
<i>Forgetting all the plans I made</i>

22:40.330 --> 22:44.340
<i>I'll walk to the next station over</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:49.010
<i>The more I trip and fall</i>

22:49.010 --> 22:53.020
<i>The better I get at picking myself back up</i>

22:53.020 --> 22:57.590
<i>Through honest dialogue and heart-to-hearts</i>

22:57.590 --> 23:01.990
<i>The warmth seeps into my soul</i>

23:01.990 --> 23:06.280
<i>Humming as I take the roundabout way</i>

23:06.280 --> 23:10.410
<i>My world is an unsolved mystery</i>

23:10.410 --> 23:14.920
<i>Top speed, toes and heels, strides</i>

23:14.920 --> 23:19.080
<i>Each one of us walks differently</i>

23:19.080 --> 23:23.600
<i>All the same, we wave goodbye to dusk</i>

23:23.600 --> 23:27.590
<i>As a new morning dawns</i>

23:27.590 --> 23:32.260
<i>Wanting to protect this everyday life</i>

23:32.260 --> 23:35.480
<i>With a hop, jump, and skip</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:38.730
<i>See you tomorrow</i>
